      "message": "As per our schema all configuration files have these properties.\n\nI don\u0027t fully understand why we are creating `N` different interfaces to expose the same 3 properties..\n\nWhat about calling `xyz.openbmc_project.Configuration.Probe` since we are exposing the `Name` and `Type` of what we probed, and the `Probe` statement itself.\n\nWe could expose this interface unconditionally as these properties will always be present.",
